{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"terence-rosemore","name":"Terence Rosemore","birthDate":"1964-07-29","birthPlace":"Great Falls, Montana, USA","bio":"Terence Rosemore was born in Great Falls, Montana and raised in New Orleans where he got his start as an Actor in Ted Gilliam's Dashiki Theatre Company.\n\nHe is an award winning Filmmaker and Actor who has worked with some of the biggest names in the industry including Robert Duvall, Halle Berry, Matthew McConaughy, Kevin Hart, Nicolas Cage, Don Cheadle, and Will Ferrell.\n\nRosemore is the founder of digital media company Out of Nowhere Films. Content created by Rosemore has been featured on NBC/Universal's DotComedy.com, ChannelME.TV and Columbia/Sony's Crackle.com.\n\nHe lives in Los Angeles writing, directing, producing and developing Film, Television and Web based projects.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:43:08+00:00","tmdbId":1411625,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1411625","credits":[{"id":"guardians-2","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2","character":"Narblik","characterFa":"ناربلیک"},{"id":"guardians-3","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3","character":"Xlomo Smeth","characterFa":"زلومو اسمث"},{"id":"guardians-holiday","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy Holiday Special","character":"Gurb","characterFa":"گورب"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/terence-rosemore.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Confession","year":2026,"character":"Harling Guidry","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7tmMQwSVVbijKV4lquYpBld3P9K.jpg"},{"name":"Superman","year":2025,"character":"Otis Berg","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ombsmhYUqR4qqOLOxAyr5V8hbyv.jpg"},{"name":"Rebel Ridge","year":2024,"character":"Mariner","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xEt2GSz9z5rSVpIHMiGdtf0czyf.jpg"},{"name":"Dead Money","year":2024,"character":"Eric","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/32JkuNsjOQwhokUNgZpajDgBEe0.jp